		{"id":"f3ddddc67bcff6e7","x":311,"y":907,"width":329,"height":362,"type":"text","text":"GET 5 accommodation partners\n\nTARGET:\n\tToronto\n\tBrampton\n\tWaterloo\n\tVancouver\n\tMississauga\n\nContact:\n\tStudent Housing Companies\n\tProperty Managers\n\tCo-living Companies\n\tHomestay Providers\n"},
		{"id":"0643de3fba7edd6c","x":186,"y":400,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Start"},
		{"id":"9836813fb3a6738a","x":-341,"y":600,"width":415,"height":368,"type":"text","text":"Create:\n\t1. Professional Gmail\n\t2. LinkedIn page\n\t3. Website:\n\t\t   Helping Indian abroad cosultants secure verified student accommodation in canada\n\t4. Whatsapp Buisness\n\t5. 2 PDF THING:\n\t\t1. A PDF TEMPLATE FOR OUR AGENCY\n\t\t2. A PDF EXPLAINING OUR SERVICE\n\t\t3.  A PDF TEMPLATE FOR SHOWCASING PROPERTIES AVAILABLE"},
		{"id":"8d245ef11d2cea0f","x":-277,"y":1223,"width":250,"height":205,"type":"text","text":"GOAL 20 consultants\n\nTarget: Tier 2 and 3 cities\n\tNew agencies\n\tSmall agencies\n\tIELTS centers\n\tVisa Offices"},
		{"id":"a17b090396368352","x":1560,"y":300,"width":250,"height":280,"type":"text","text":"Consultent send:\n- Student Name\n- College\n- City\n- Budget\n- Move-in Date\n- Gender\n- Room Preference"},
		{"id":"b6ffafc5dcb13650","x":2220,"y":700,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"make the available properties PDF"},
		{"id":"b69cbb7dafb625e6","x":2040,"y":300,"width":250,"height":252,"type":"text","text":"I call on the CANADIAN ACCOMOADATION ppl and get :\n- 3–5 verified options\n- Photos\n- Rent\n- Deposit\n- Distance to campus"},
		{"id":"670b5a0c5e3be824","x":1685,"y":840,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Provide the pdf to tbhe consultant"},
